<app-shell u-s="{{['d']}}" u-i="acbabcbe-0" bind:__l="__l"><view class="qs-cover"><view class="qs-cover-copy"><text class="eyebrow">使用指南 / QUICK START</text><text class="page-title">跟着做一遍，比读说明更快。</text><text class="muted">三步上手，再按兴趣出发。不需要登录，也不会打断你的浏览。</text></view><view class="qs-cover-progress"><text class="qs-count">{{a}}<text class="qs-count-total"> / 3</text></text><text class="small">{{b}}</text></view></view><view class="section-heading"><view><text class="eyebrow">01 / 上手三步</text><text class="section-title">读人物、查依据、问小迹</text></view></view><view class="qs-steps"><view wx:for="{{c}}" wx:for-item="s" wx:key="g" class="{{['qs-step', s.h && 'done', s.i && 'next']}}"><text class="qs-no">{{s.a}}</text><view class="qs-step-copy"><text class="qs-step-title">{{s.b}}</text><text class="qs-step-text">{{s.c}}</text></view><button class="{{['qs-step-go', s.e && 'primary']}}" bindtap="{{s.f}}">{{s.d}}</button></view></view><view class="section-heading"><view><text class="eyebrow">02 / 按目标选路径</text><text class="section-title">你现在想做什么？</text></view></view><view class="qs-paths"><view wx:for="{{d}}" wx:for-item="p" wx:key="f" class="qs-path"><image src="{{p.a}}" aria-hidden="true"/><view class="qs-path-copy"><text class="qs-path-title">{{p.b}}</text><text class="qs-path-text">{{p.c}}</text></view><button class="qs-path-go" bindtap="{{p.e}}">{{p.d}} ↗</button></view></view><view class="qs-story"><text>想体验一个完整的互动故事？</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="{{e}}">进入江姐互动故事 ↗</button></view><view class="section-heading"><view><text class="eyebrow">03 / 遇到疑问，再来这里</text><text class="section-title">常见的几个问题</text></view></view><view class="qs-faq"><view wx:for="{{f}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="g" class="qs-faq-item"><button aria-expanded="{{item.c}}" bindtap="{{item.d}}"><text>{{item.a}}</text><text>{{item.b}}</text></button><text wx:if="{{item.e}}" class="qs-faq-answer">{{item.f}}</text></view></view><view class="qs-bottom"><text class="small">新手提示只出现一次。想重新体验，可以清空进度。</text><view class="qs-bottom-actions"><button class="outline" bindtap="{{g}}">重新开始新手提示</button><button class="outline" bindtap="{{h}}">回到首页</button></view></view></app-shell>